om/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Magical_Efficiency\" title=\"Magical Efficiency\">Magical Efficiency 5%</a>:</b> You take a 5% Enhancement discount to the <a href=\"/page/Spell_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Point\">Spell Point</a> cost of your spells.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Hat_of_the_Night_Hag.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Hat_of_the_Night_Hag.png/420px-Hat_of_the_Night_Hag.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"229\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Hat_of_the_Night_Hag.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Many candy-loving hags died to bring us this hat.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li><b>Bug: </b> Is not visible on <a href=\"/page/Dragonborn\" title=\"Dragonborn\">Dragonborn</a> or <a href=\"/page/Tiefling\" title=\"Tiefling\">Tiefling</a> characters.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817045052\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced e